  <p>
    We don’t guarantee the Site will be uninterrupted or error-free, and may
    modify or discontinue any part of it at any time.
  </p>

  <h2 id="warranties">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
  <p>
    THE SITE AND ITS CONTENT ARE PROVIDED “AS IS” AND “AS AVAILABLE” WITHOUT
    WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, WHETHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING IMPLIED
    WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, AND
    NON-INFRINGEMENT.
