    We may update these Terms from time to time; the date above shows the latest
    version. Your continued use of the Site constitutes acceptance of the revised
    Terms.
  </p>

  <h2 id="contact">12. Contact Us</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these Terms? Email
    <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.supportEmail}`}>{CONTACT.supportEmail}</a>.
  </p>
  <p>{SITE.legalName}<br />306 W Redwood St, Ste 201<br />Baltimore, MD 21201, United States</p>
